{
  "dom_id": "step-615704",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Solving Word Problems Involving Percentage Increases Greater Than 100%",
  "problem": "A gym had $80$ members last year. This year, membership is $400\\%$ greater than last year. How many members does the gym have this year?",
  "worked_solution": "To find this year's gym membership, we apply a $400\\%$ increase to last year's figure.\n\nIncreasing by $400\\%$ means that we must apply a new percentage of\n\n$$\n100\\% + 400\\% = 500\\%.\n$$\n\nWe begin by converting the percentage to a decimal:\n\n$$\n500\\% = \\dfrac{500}{100} = 5\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply the original amount by $5{:}$\n\n$$\n80 \\times 5 = 400\n$$\n\nSo, the gym has $\\bbox[4pt, border: 1px solid lightgray]{400}$ members this year.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-615704\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"615704\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"22093\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-615704\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-13\">Solving Word Problems Involving Percentage Increases Greater Than 100%</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"615704\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            ma